      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "BENEFITS\n- Lower time to first validated output\n- Smoother UX and safe incremental delivery\n- Validation cost may be reduced with useful chunk boundaries",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "tqgtwvOzJ2xtdwKWPZsw2",
      "originalText": "BENEFITS\n- Lower time to first validated output\n- Smoother UX and safe incremental delivery\n- Validation cost may be reduced with useful chunk boundaries",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b6Z"
    },
    {
