      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 12.982478545444991,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "LIMITATIONS / VERIFY SUPPORT\n\n- Reask usually cannot rewind an\n  already-running stream.\n- If needed, terminate, then use a new\n  request / retry.\n- Deterministic actions: FIX, FILTER,\n  REFRAIN, NOOP where supported.\n- Support varies by validator, action,\n  output type, and version.\n- Streaming remediation is not a\n  universal automatic guarantee.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "2KoksLD6mQMLNy7fG9t8v",
      "originalText": "LIMITATIONS / VERIFY SUPPORT\n\n- Reask usually cannot rewind an\n  already-running stream.\n- If needed, terminate, then use a new\n  request / retry.\n- Deterministic actions: FIX, FILTER,\n  REFRAIN, NOOP where supported.\n- Support varies by validator, action,\n  output type, and version.\n- Streaming remediation is not a\n  universal automatic guarantee.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bCY"
    },
